!
! The companion's growth stage from its generation (kitling_rules.h KR1),
! in Trebago: one step for each threshold reached, 1, 2, 5, 13 and 34
! (every other Fibonacci number), so 0 newborn .. 5 sage. For integers
! min(1, max(0, g - t + 1)) is 1 exactly when g >= t. A generation is
! 0 .. 4294967295 (swarm_dna.h D5 keeps it in 32 bits): r is 1 inside that
! and 0 outside, and r * s + r - 1 answers -1 there, refused as the C
! refuses it. stage.kron counts the steps of any integer: held.
trebago stage
  in  generation(n)
  out stage(n)
  stage(i) = min(1, max(0, generation(i) + 1)) * min(1, max(0, 4294967295 - generation(i) + 1)) &
           * (min(1, max(0, generation(i))) + min(1, max(0, generation(i) - 1)) &
           + min(1, max(0, generation(i) - 4)) + min(1, max(0, generation(i) - 12)) &
           + min(1, max(0, generation(i) - 33))) &
           + min(1, max(0, generation(i) + 1)) * min(1, max(0, 4294967295 - generation(i) + 1)) - 1
end
